                        "review": "Found the game series originally on the app store and decided to buy the series in the bundle- so here are my thoughts on this game (writing this review LONG after playing, so forgive me for my lack of detail):\n\nTo be honest, it was okay as a game? \n\nI'm not sure exactly what it was about it that made me not like it as much as the other games in the series, but I genuinely could not enjoy it no matter how hard I tried? \n\nMaybe it's just because of how they handled the two leads? Usually I like character dynamics like them- but I guess the way they were handled in this game made me not like it all that much.\n\nStill, if you're a fan of the series overall, I'd say play it for the heck of it since this game segways into the 3rd installment fairly well.",
